{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Bo shrugs. \"I have what i desire, I have my friends.\" He motions to everyone in the room, even Malathor. \"Even those not in this room, I had only ever desired to have friends.\" He places a hand on his chin. \"But now that i have friends....i'm not sure what i want.\" He smiles warmly still thinking.","created_at":"2021-07-19T20:52:36.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866784615720288256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
