{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I just wanna help other's as best I can! If its riches, then the money will go to the poor, if its glory... I'd rather it not be me, but someone else.\" He smiles. \"Fame? Nah, i'll work on that myself. Aint no point if you get tossed to the top o' the pile. Gotta climb it yourself!.\" There is nothing material I want, nor power if it isnt my own to begin with.\" \n\n(And yes... This is bo. He has and always be this way, especially after the mender asked him to just be himself.)","created_at":"2021-07-19T20:57:21.330000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T20:57:46.230000Z","id":"866785810522963968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Malathor continues to stare, and then, slowly, he nods. And then he lets out a little chuckle like the sound of a catfish caught on a hook. \"Yes... Yes I think I understand Mr. Bo. In anycase, should you think of something, come, seek me out. I shall owe you *one* favor. In the mean time, I may come to you again with more requests in the future, if you would be willing to aid a tired old man...\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T21:00:40.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866786645852028968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Besides...i gained a friend today. Said so yerself!\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T21:00:43.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866786657294352424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Indeed my friend, *indeed*.\" Malathor leans in and whispers to you, while grabbing hold of your wrist and tracing a symbol with his finger. ||\"*remember this Bo, Sometimes your imagination plays tricks on you; sometimes it doesn't. Knowing the difference can save your life . . . or your soul.*\"||","created_at":"2021-07-19T21:02:34.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866787122374901771","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Bo smiles back. || \"If it comes down to that one day, then there must'a been a reason for it. As long as I am still me, and helping friends, it'd be a life worth living.\" ||","created_at":"2021-07-19T21:07:21.914000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866788329554837584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
